@spartacus/storefront (core-libs/storefront)
CMS エンジン: PageLayoutComponent / PageSlotComponent / ComponentWrapperDirective / ComponentHandler / CmsInjectorService / CmsComponentData / Outlet
LayoutConfig(layoutSlots)・標準 CMS コンポーネント(Banner, Paragraph, Link, ProductCarousel, Navigation …)・BaseStorefrontModule

@spartacus/core (core-libs/core)
モデル(CmsComponent 派生)・設定 DI(provideConfig / Config / deepMerge)・NgRx(StateModule, cms/product/site-context ストア, Entity Loader)・Facade(CmsService, ProductService)
Connector / Adapter / Converter(Normalizer)・OccEndpointsService(baseUrl + prefix + ${baseSiteId})・Routing(ConfigurableRoutes, CmsPageGuard 用 PageContext)・i18n(i18next)・LazyLoading
